sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Controller as CheckinController
    participant Service as CheckinService
    participant LikeRepository
    Client->>Controller: GET /check-in/{checkin_id}/like
    Controller->>Service: get_like_for_checkin(checkin_id)
    Service->>LikeRepository: count_likes_for_checkin(checkin_id)
    LikeRepository-->>Service: like_count
    Service-->>Controller: like_count
    Controller-->>Client: like_count